Package: MLSnpDR
Title: Machine-Learning-Guided Subtype-Specific Network Drug Repurposing
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "LilyYNY", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "suda_sysbio@hotmail.com"),
    person(given = "Soochow", family = "University", role = "cph",
           comment = "Copyright holder of the upstream subnetDR project")
  )
Author: LilyYNY [aut, cre], Soochow University [cph]
Maintainer: LilyYNY <suda_sysbio@hotmail.com>
Description: Builds subtype-specific protein interaction network modules,
    scores their subtype representativeness with machine learning, integrates
    survival and drug-response evidence, and restricts sequence, binding, and
    perturbation-response analyses to selected modules.
